            <h2 id="feature">It was the most requested feature! And a pain to make it work</h2>
            <p>Web search engines have too much power over what you see, read, interact with online.
            The worst cases are personalized results, where they don't even show the other point of view on a problem.
            Villainizing the other side and dividing people.</p>
            <br><p>At PriEco we also must create a general algorithm designed to rank results as well as possible. But! Even though we strive to find the best information for your questions, it is impossible to please everyone.</p>
            <br><p>The only solution is letting the community create filter lists you can apply and by giving you a really simple interface to adjust the ranking to your liking. Whether you use a filter or base PriEco ranking.</p>

